/E (It is with great pleasure that we present the third edition of the CAREER COMPASS HANDBOOK, which serves as a comprehensive resource for the student community in Sri Lanka. This publication, initiated by IEEE Sri Lanka Inspire, a project under the auspices of IEEE Young Professionals Sri Lanka in collaboration with SL2 College, reflects our commitment to improving the education system in Sri Lanka and equipping students with the necessary skills and knowledge to succeed in higher education and the workforce. This booklet contains the important information on the higher education opportunities in Sri Lanka.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 394 0 R
/E (We would like to express our sincere gratitude to everyone who has helped make this project possible by lending their time, knowledge, and resources. Your efforts to connect with the Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\) of the United Nations, create a community of professionals, educators, and students, and give them the resources and encouragement they need to achieve have all benefited greatly from your assistance. This CAREER COMPASS guide is evidence of our dedication to helping students succeed by empowering and supporting them as they navigate their academic path.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
