536 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 398 0 R
/T (IEEE Sri Lanka Inspire \(SLI\) is a national project, initiated under IEEE Young Professionals Sri Lanka \(IEEE YPSL\), that focuses on providing advice, knowledge, guidance and motivation for pre- University students \(school students\) to make a proper selection when moving towards higher education to raise themselves to achieve a successful career path through research, advocacy and policy recommendations ensuring students are prepared for higher education and the workforce of the country. To achieve the vision, IEEE Sri Lanka Inspire aims to build a strong community among the students, especially the school students who are currently at their peak in school education; those engaging with O/Ls and A/Ls, students who have been selected to universities and all other educational strategies to ensure equal access to educational, professional and vocational opportunities for their journey of higher education, making the educational system of the country more effectively and efficiently)
/E (IEEE Sri Lanka Inspire \(SLI\) is a national project, initiated under IEEE Young Professionals Sri Lanka \(IEEE YPSL\), that focuses on providing advice, knowledge, guidance and motivation for pre- University students \(school students\) to make a proper selection when moving towards higher education to raise themselves to achieve a successful career path through research, advocacy and policy recommendations ensuring students are prepared for higher education and the workforce of the country. To achieve the vision, IEEE Sri Lanka Inspire aims to build a strong community among the students, especially the school students who are currently at their peak in school education; those engaging with O/Ls and A/Ls, students who have been selected to universities and all other educational strategies to ensure equal access to educational, professional and vocational opportunities for their journey of higher education, making the educational system of the country more effectively and efficiently)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
